{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026v16hSUVA4r1788410701.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">熱帶風暴沙德爾，早上在福建漳州登陸，中心風力達9級。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">沙德爾在漳州漳浦古雷沿海第三次登陸，距離登陸地點約10公里的福建東山澳角碼頭位於其風暴圈內，當地風雨強勁，漁船返回碼頭避風。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.TYPHOON 1130.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jpaXOsZTLS1788410696.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.TYPHOON 1130.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">沙德爾也影響廣東。在汕頭所有學校停課，濱海景區關閉，南澳大橋臨時封閉，渡輪全部停航。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">氣象部門預計沙德爾帶來的影響將在明日起逐步減弱。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.TYPHOON 1130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026lnu4VzTlVo1788410699.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.TYPHOON 1130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T05:04:26.042383+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}